# ============================================
# SATŪS — Environment Variables
# ============================================
# Reference list only. Add a value with `bun dotenvx set KEY "value"`: it lands
# encrypted in .env (README § Environment variables). Copy a line into
# .env.local for a personal override.
#
# Nothing here is required to boot the starter. Every integration is optional
# and self-disables when its env vars are absent. To add one:
#
#   • Scaffold env vars:   bun run setup:project
#   • Full list + types:   lib/env.ts          (Zod-validated source of truth)
#   • Per-integration:     lib/integrations/<name>/README.md
#                          (sanity · shopify · hubspot · mailchimp)
# ============================================

# Public site URL — SEO, canonical URLs, OG images, sitemap, robots.
# Optional: on Vercel it comes from the production domain (production) or the
# branch URL (previews); locally it falls back to localhost. Set it to
# override, when hosting elsewhere, or when the primary domain isn't the
# shortest one (Vercel picks the shortest, e.g. the apex over www).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=
